g with philosophy and some  some explicit way often using the term  philosophy then I've discussed here so  this is just sort of scratching the  surface but I'm hoping that the people  that I've talked about you know I think  they're acknowledged as being pretty  central and being the the  representatives of Christian philosophy  early Christian philosophy so you know I  I'm I'm not steering you wrong with that  but there's there's a lot more if you're  going to do self directed study in this  that that you would want to explore more  obscure figures going deeper into some  of them and seeing the connections  between them so that's what I'll leave  with the great task ahead of you if you  take this challenge on if not you know  there's plenty of other thinkers to  study as well  you
 

